Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This arrow is irreplaceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's essential to my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And losing it is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, leave that arrow alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll bleed out if you keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of the failings\Nof my blockhead brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now have no other\Nchoice but to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing personal, but I can't\Nlet anything happen to the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't do for it to break or\Ncatch the eye of some old crone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given my meticulous nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel somewhat compelled to\Nreturn it to its proper place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what should one do when\None is finished listening to a CD?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should put the first in its\Ncase before listening to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how everyone does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's how I do things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:01:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've decided to enter our abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No shit, Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else was I supposed to beat your\Nsmarmy ass and get Koichi back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.66,0:01:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.57,0:01:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't count me out just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.36,0:01:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for me to help before\Nyou attack him! Attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.76,0:01:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight is just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something moving\Nup there in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GASP
