Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.65,0:02:58.24,Title Part 4 Episode 2,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(614,626)\pos(132,880)\fs60}Episode 4: {\fs80} The Nijimura Brothers Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.82,0:02:58.61,Main,Josuke,0,0,0,,{\an8}Okuyasu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.22,0:02:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stupidity is truly astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't stumbled in\Nhere like a bumbling idiot,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worse company would have\Nalready destroyed Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's more, you walked\Nright into the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But bro, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your stand, the hand, may be menacing,\Nbut you, little brother, are a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The incompetent will hinder\Nthe capable without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.50,0:03:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've told you over and\Nover since we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And life is only worth\Nliving when it has growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard that before, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen wounds like those before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of attack leaves\Nyou looking like a pincushion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor little brother. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's idiots like you who deserve to\Ndie like a miserable roach on its back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.06,0:03:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fiddling the place with tiny holes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.64,0:03:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster attacks\Nhis own freakin' brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how dire the situation,\Nhe would never abandon this brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to bet he'll be\Nback to save him soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll die by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As will anyone who gets in\Nthe way of this bow and arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wipe them all out of existence!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I think it's way past time\Nyou tell me about your brother's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of power does his stand have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spill it and I'll get rid\Nof these holes in your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.60,0:05:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I told, I'll never rat my\Nbrother out. Understand? Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just how it's gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.06,0:05:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're not gonna help,\Njust stay out of my way, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.12,0:05:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi doesn't have much time,\Nso I have to move quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If earlier is any indication, his stand's\Ngonna attack from somewhere in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One thing's for sure, this is gonna suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to rely on instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Senses don't fail me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta know, Josuke, why the\Nhell did you heal my injuries?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.18,0:05:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, let me focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't it cross your mind\Nthat I might attack you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:06:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am your enemy, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That depends on how\Nyou answer my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you heal me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having a hard time piecing things\Ntogether, so hurry up and tell me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, what the hell happened to your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did my bro do that to you when\Nyou were pulling me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this is making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you go through so much\Ntrouble to try and save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.82,0:06:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think anyone needed to die today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.54,0:06:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, it's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was taken upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished asking questions, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your goddamn mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.82,0:07:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to rescue Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanna know why!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.50,0:07:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you use your stance healing\Npower to patch up those holes in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of wrapping it like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could just make it all\Nbetter, like you did my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.00,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that's not how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shining Diamond can't heal my own wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is, life isn't\Nalways as easy as we want it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While we're on the subject, I can't bring\Nback the dead no matter how hard I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last thing, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how Koichi's doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if he doesn't pull through, I'm\Ngonna take it out on your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if shit hits the fan, be pissed off at\Nyour bro, cause all of this is his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:07:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:07:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If so, go outside and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.26,0:08:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, this has to be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll probably ambush me as\Nsoon as I get close to Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it is a trap, this may\Nbe my only chance to save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His life is on the line, so\Nthere's no time to hesitate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.48,0:08:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yosuke!
