Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We teleported.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.04,0:08:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the smartest guy in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think with my\Nheart instead of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll repay you for what you\Ndid for me just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:08:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where my gratitude ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:09:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not helping you out anymore,\Nbut I won't help my bro either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's great to hear, Okuyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.98,0:09:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You held up pretty great\Nback there, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so thrilled to see you're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.42,0:09:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many fingers do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.59,0:09:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember my neck being\Nslammed hard between the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After that, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to have to tell you this, Koichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.70,0:09:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but things haven't gotten any\Nbetter while you were napping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want to do right now is walk down\Nthose stairs and leave this place behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.42,0:09:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something tells me Okuyasu's\Nbrother won't exactly comply with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's lurking up there,\Nbut it's staying out of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something ran across that beam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, I know you just woke up\Nand none of this makes sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but for now I need you to keep\Nquiet and stay close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a hell of a lot creepier\Nwhen I couldn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting a look at it is actually a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we've got a\Npesky runt on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.06,0:10:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as that little shit shows himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll blast him to kingdom\Ncome with Crazy Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll get the hell out\Nof here as fast as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.74,0:10:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a ton of those things!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're all in some kind of uniform!
