Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.24,0:10:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like we're being ambushed\Nby a bunch of toy paratroopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the power of\NOkuyasu's brother's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a few, but taking out two or\Nthree of them isn't going to be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.12,0:11:17.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They leave tiny wounds, but the\Ndamage definitely packs a wallop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't play this smart, we're\Ngoing to be in major trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.00,0:11:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since my idiotic little brother decided\Nto meddle with my trap and save that brat,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my plan has gone off the rails somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.52,0:11:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the grand scheme,\Nit's of little consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never escape this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.08,0:11:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or the domination of my perfectly\Nsynchronized stand, Worst Company!
