Dialogue: 3,0:11:46.01,0:11:47.06,Eyecatch - Left,signbot,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(82,794)\shad1.5\4a&HFF&}Nijimura Keicho
Dialogue: 1,0:11:46.01,0:11:47.06,Eyecatch - Left,signbot,0,0,0,,{\pos(82,794)}Nijimura Keicho
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So his stand is called Worst Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, what's\Ngoing on? Ask me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's crazy, but\NI need you to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All units, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.82,0:12:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.18,0:12:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clare to base!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.74,0:12:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These little bastards have the\Nfirepower to blow us to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we've got windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know we're on the second floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we've got to break those\Nwindows and jump to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much for that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.84,0:12:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've even got helicopters, but\Nhow's his stand taking the form of U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Army Apache choppers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got a tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, those are definitely tanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, careful. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.02,0:13:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to run that\Nby me one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you actually see the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The soldiers, tanks,\Nhelicopters, all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.70,0:13:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's\Ngoing on, but I can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.62,0:13:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it didn't kill you, it\Nmust have given you a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so the Shrimp has one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.08,0:13:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's finally got the power to use a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This certainly is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the man of the\Nhour, Okuyasu's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.56,0:13:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty ballsy move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showing off your stand like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.98,0:13:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can think of my stand worse\Ncompany as a cast iron defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.24,0:13:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It renders all attacks and intruders incapable\Nof penetrating its protective shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're itching to\Nput me out of commission,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but sadly, it's a pipe dream\Nthat will never come to fruition?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as your shining diamonds attacks\Nwill never get anywhere close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The perfect symmetry of my army's\Nformation is simply stunning, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All units, maintain\Nbattle formation at ease!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just nothing quite like having\Neverything beautifully in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though you did destroy a few of my foot\Nsoldiers with your attack, so my troops'
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,formation is irritatingly\Nasymmetrical now. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.02,0:14:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you did say you were meticulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But did you really need to come out of\Nyour hiding spot to tell us all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what on earth would\Ngive you that idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came out here to observe\Nthe little troublemaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.10,0:14:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I recall, Koichi was your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ironic that you appear to have the\Ninnate ability to utilize a stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:15:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manifest your stand right now and\Nshow me the extent of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If today's my lucky day,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may just possess the ability\NI've spent so long trying to uncover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me your power and\NI'll allow you to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what ability would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about time you told\Nus what your endgame is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be asking the questions around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.40,0:15:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear, Jazz King?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, I still\Nhave you in my crosshairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.02,0:15:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be thanking me for\Nletting you live as long as I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.08,0:15:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just great.\NLet's go! Get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manifest your stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.30,0:15:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I have no clue what you mean. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.62,0:15:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be a sport and show him\Nhow to manifest his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The striking range of your Shining\NDiamond is only a measly one meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a long shot, but if this wimp's stand\Ncan compensate for the weakness of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.02,0:15:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might have a real chance\Nat escaping my company.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.12,0:16:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand that could kick your ass would\Nbe an awesome addition to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, materializing your\Nstand is easy, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.78,0:16:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramp up the urge to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.90,0:16:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe think about pummeling\Nthis guy until he's black and blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest boils down to instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand unique to your spiritual\Nenergy should reveal itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.02,0:16:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just bring that on me\Nand expect me to know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then please allow me to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's some inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.24,0:16:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, Green Beret!
