Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, you have to try moving it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.50,0:17:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now open your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I made this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll congratulate you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we need to find out what\Nthis egg-shaped thing can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What it can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.64,0:17:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the heck you\Nthink is supposed to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't have any energy left!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the best I could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.06,0:17:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen everything I need to!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.34,0:17:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All units, get in battle formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.28,0:17:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, withdraw your stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.26,0:17:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they destroy this egg, you'll die too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.80,0:17:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light him up, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aaaaah!
