Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your... Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two have been separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crack in that egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The brat doesn't realize it, but\Nhe might have something there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the only man dying today is Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word to the wise, Sergeant. Bro. So,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're trying to bring the roof of this
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dump down on our heads in a fiery inferno,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then do it and stop playing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.98,0:18:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.52,0:18:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm in the mood for a brawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it true that you strongly disapprove of\Ndisparaging remarks related to your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you find out for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, I dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:19:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I don't think\Nthat'll be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead, I'll blow your head right off\Nfrom underneath that prized hair of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider yourself forewarned!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first-worst company will\Nfire bullets into your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll keep you from running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, we'll focus on taking out your arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once that's done, you'll have\Nno means of defending yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.94,0:19:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving me Card blanche to blow\Nyour brains and hair into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.34,0:19:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds like a bulletproof\Nplan if I ever heard one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you overlook the fact that\Nit's completely impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already told you how meticulous I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I declare something, I stick to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, the warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is make that\Nstand thing appear again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only an egg,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.58,0:19:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if I can somehow hurl it\Nat him and make a direct hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be able to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Koichi, time\Nto rise to the occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only reason I'm still letting you draw
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.90,0:20:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,breath is because your stand intrigues me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.80,0:20:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All units aim, fire at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sergeant Bro,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.72,0:20:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have you ever heard the\Nstory where Moses parts
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.76,0:20:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the waters of the Red Sea\Nright down the middle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because that's what I'm about\Nto do to your pathetic army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'm going to beat you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plan is proceeding\Nexactly as I forewarned!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're too big of a fool to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A landmine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, your legs will go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Apaches, release your\Nfirepower and disable him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First the legs, then the arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly as I predicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hellfire is going to rain down\Non you with a flurry of bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can those wounded arms of yours save you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or will worse company tear you apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find out as it fires\Nevery missile shell and round!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lose, Josuke Higashikata!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All units!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready, aim!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what exactly do\Nyou think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be you're accepting your fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.22,0:21:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is it that you're asking\Nme to show you mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you nerds take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you've got me cornered, but\NI've already implemented my tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:21:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure those are the missiles\NI shot at Josuke's arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He turned them against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My Crazy Diamond's special ability is to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,repair almost anything that's been broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, if you're that forgetful,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.10,0:22:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might want to take some notes\Nand make sure you're meticulous.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.93,0:22:53.31,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.06,0:22:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any time I need to see a\Nface, it has closed my eyes,
